# ---- CRC-32 ----
__crc32b | crc | (crc: u32, data: u8) -> u32 | intr | crc32b <d:w>, <crc:w>, <data:w> | pure | none | crc.8 | r = CRC-32 (ISO-HDLC, gzip's, reflected, no inversion) of crc and data's 1 byte | - | one step of CRC-32 over 1 byte
