__crc32d | crc | (crc: u32, data: u64) -> u32 | intr | crc32x <d:w>, <crc:w>, <data:x> | pure | none | crc.64 | r = CRC-32 (ISO-HDLC, gzip's, reflected, no inversion) of crc and data's 8 bytes | - | one step of CRC-32 over 8 bytes
