vsha1pq_u32 | sha2 | (hash_abcd: uint32x4_t, hash_e: u32, wk: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | fmov <u:s>, <hash_e:w>; sha1p <d:q>, <u:s>, <wk>.4s | pure tied=hash_abcd | none | - | four SHA-1 rounds (parity) of hash_abcd and hash_e with wk (FIPS 180-4) | x86_64: _mm_sha1rnds4_epu32 | four SHA-1 rounds with the parity function: the new abcd
