vsha1h_u32 | sha2 | (hash_e: u32) -> u32 | intr | fmov <t:s>, <hash_e:w>; sha1h <t:s>, <t:s>; fmov <d:w>, <t:s> | pure | none | - | r = (ROL(hash_e, 30)) | x86_64: _mm_sha1nexte_epu32 | SHA-1's fixed rotate: hash_e rotated left by 30
vsha1su0q_u32 | sha2 | (w0_3: uint32x4_t, w4_7: uint32x4_t, w8_11: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | sha1su0 <d>.4s, <w4_7>.4s, <w8_11>.4s | pure tied=w0_3 | none | - | the first half of SHA-1's message schedule update | x86_64: _mm_sha1msg1_epu32 | SHA-1 schedule update, part 1
vsha1su1q_u32 | sha2 | (tw0_3: uint32x4_t, w12_15: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | sha1su1 <d>.4s, <w12_15>.4s | pure tied=tw0_3 | none | - | the second half of SHA-1's message schedule update | x86_64: _mm_sha1msg2_epu32 | SHA-1 schedule update, part 2
