vsha256h2q_u32 | sha2 | (hash_efgh: uint32x4_t, hash_abcd: uint32x4_t, wk: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | sha256h2 <d:q>, <hash_abcd:q>, <wk>.4s | pure tied=hash_efgh | none | - | four SHA-256 rounds: the new efgh (FIPS 180-4) | x86_64: _mm_sha256rnds2_epu32 (two rounds) | four SHA-256 rounds of the state with wk: the new efgh (pass the old abcd, before vsha256hq_u32)
vsha256su0q_u32 | sha2 | (w0_3: uint32x4_t, w4_7: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | sha256su0 <d>.4s, <w4_7>.4s | pure tied=w0_3 | none | - | the first half of SHA-256's message schedule update (sigma0) | x86_64: _mm_sha256msg1_epu32 | SHA-256 schedule update, part 1
vsha256su1q_u32 | sha2 | (tw0_3: uint32x4_t, w8_11: uint32x4_t, w12_15: uint32x4_t) -> uint32x4_t | intr | sha256su1 <d>.4s, <w8_11>.4s, <w12_15>.4s | pure tied=tw0_3 | none | - | the second half of SHA-256's message schedule update (sigma1) | x86_64: _mm_sha256msg2_epu32 | SHA-256 schedule update, part 2

