vdotq_laneq_s32 | dotprod | (acc: int32x4_t, a: int8x16_t, b: int8x16_t, lane: const 0..=3) -> int32x4_t | intr | sdot <d>.4s, <a>.16b, <b>.4b[<lane>] | pure tied=acc | none | dot | r[k] = acc[k] + a[4 * k] * b[4 * lane] + a[4 * k + 1] * b[4 * lane + 1] + a[4 * k + 2] * b[4 * lane + 2] + a[4 * k + 3] * b[4 * lane + 3] | - | each 32-bit lane of acc plus the dot product of its four bytes of a and b's group `lane`
